{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/klcYMbMYGeOOvH3JL8d1FA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:18.467664+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/klcYMbMYGeOOvH3JL8d1FA","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/MVPvEL7Qg0FhvN6GSJUZ8G2RzcNUt1aApcxefiahWtDbDRuZuGkic8HtH2ozaXIHhdvNibBd4hc2ztpmNGe0xPJQg/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>点击蓝字 </span><span><span>关注我们</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/oQyFS1aYtNJxeSjwSCbJfJ7uKHXGL4Z2WibNdcz05icJsxLd9Diac6s490icn95HoaaqpfbFeiaeLMfbpcwywOEb8WB8nTvFrEqVib12JFZXmQxdM/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>华东师范大学出版硕士专业学位项目（简称“出版专硕项目”）依托部校共建出版学院和国家新闻出版署高端智库上海出版研究院，旨在以马克思主义出版观为引领，为加快建成社会主义出版强国、构建中国特色哲学社会科学体系、促进人类文明传承，培养掌握扎实的出版基础理论和实践技能，紧跟新时代出版产业前沿，具有较强的问题意识，拥有国际视野、家国情怀和全媒体传播素养的高层次出版人才。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/oQyFS1aYtNLLUp29S0fJfooSty7kNWD0Adicl55CqX38nF8Z8LA73FiaKLbI65wU3WG6KG1xc4yohOfEoXRkEwFd0fe0Jsib9AEsfToBGS51Nk/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>项目简介</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>华东师大出版专硕项目（代码055300，今年新增“教材出版与传播”方向）设置于传播学院（出版学院），由华东师范大学传播学院（出版学院）、上海出版研究院与华东师范大学出版社联合培养，实行专业教师与业界导师联合的双导师制培养模式，拥有上海世纪出版集团、各大学出版社、阅文集团等诸多产教融合实践基地。毕业生广泛分布在上海及全国各地的出版社、互联网内容运营商、民营文化公司、企事业单位文化宣传岗位及相关行业。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/oQyFS1aYtNLLUp29S0fJfooSty7kNWD0Adicl55CqX38nF8Z8LA73FiaKLbI65wU3WG6KG1xc4yohOfEoXRkEwFd0fe0Jsib9AEsfToBGS51Nk/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>项目特色</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>华东师大出版专硕项目依托部校共建出版学院和高端出版智库上海出版研究院整合优质资源，全面深化产教融合，不断优化教学模式和实习实训机制。以新时代出版业数智化转型和高质量发展为创新人才培养驱动力，打通第一课堂和第二课堂。充分发挥双导师作用，全面提升学生的出版理论水平和实践技能，培养具有国际视野和家国情怀、兼具创新和创业能力的复合型出版人才。</span><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/oQyFS1aYtNLLUp29S0fJfooSty7kNWD0Adicl55CqX38nF8Z8LA73FiaKLbI65wU3WG6KG1xc4yohOfEoXRkEwFd0fe0Jsib9AEsfToBGS51Nk/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>师资力量</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>华东师大出版专硕项目现有专任教师10余人，均毕业于国内外名校，具有高学历、国际化的特点，其中多名教师是拥有丰富行业经验的双师型导师。另有跨学科联聘导师和行业导师数十人，研究方向涵盖教育出版、专业出版和大众出版的各个领域，可以为出版专业硕士全面而自由地发展提供强大的支撑。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/oQyFS1aYtNLLUp29S0fJfooSty7kNWD0Adicl55CqX38nF8Z8LA73FiaKLbI65wU3WG6KG1xc4yohOfEoXRkEwFd0fe0Jsib9AEsfToBGS51Nk/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>具体内容</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span>1．学分要求</span></strong></p><p><span>出版专硕项目总学分修读要求为37学分，其中：公共课（必修）5学分，专业必修课18学分，专业选修课10学分，专业实践课4学分。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>2．培养方式</span></strong></p><p><span>出版专业硕士采用专业教师和行业导师相结合的双导师培养模式，全日制培养，学制三年，学费3.5万/年。由学校统一安排住宿，住宿费为1200元/年（具体以学校主管部门发布为准）。奖助体系完备。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/oQyFS1aYtNLLUp29S0fJfooSty7kNWD0Adicl55CqX38nF8Z8LA73FiaKLbI65wU3WG6KG1xc4yohOfEoXRkEwFd0fe0Jsib9AEsfToBGS51Nk/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>1.中华人民共和国公民，拥护中国共产党领导，遵纪守法、品德良好；</span></p><p><span>2.已获得或预计获得就读学校推荐免试资格的优秀应届本科毕业生；</span></p><p><span>3.学习成绩优异，具有较强的创新意识、研究潜质和专业基础；</span></p><p><span>4.诚实守信，学风端正，无任何有违学术道德、专业伦理等行为；</span></p><p><span>5.身心健康，符合国家规定的体检要求；</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/oQyFS1aYtNLLUp29S0fJfooSty7kNWD0Adicl55CqX38nF8Z8LA73FiaKLbI65wU3WG6KG1xc4yohOfEoXRkEwFd0fe0Jsib9AEsfToBGS51Nk/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名流程</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span>（一）时间及方式</span></strong></p><p><span>有意申请的考生即日起可登录华东师范大学研究生报考服务系统（https://yjszs-ks.ecnu.edu.cn/logon?zsxm=5，以下简称报名系统）注册账号，每位考生最多可注册两个账号，填报两条独立志愿。我院预报名截止时间为9月1日16:00，报名截止前，考生可自行取消提交状态、修改完善后再次提交，请考生务必留意截止时间，尽早报名。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>（二）报名材料</span></strong></p><p><span>1.有效居民身份证；</span></p><p><span>2.教育部学籍在线验证报告；</span></p><p><span>3.预报名申请表（报名系统填写完毕后下载打印、签字后扫描上传）；</span></p><p><span>4.诚信承诺书（报名系统下载打印、签字后扫描上传）；</span></p><p><span>5.成绩排名证明或推免排名证明，注明本专业总人数，并加盖学校教务部门或学院公章；</span></p><p><span>6.其他材料（请合并为一个PDF上传）：①本科期间成绩单（加盖公章）；②其他能证明个人学术能力的材料，包括但不限于学术科研成果、获奖证书、外语能力证明等。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/oQyFS1aYtNLLUp29S0fJfooSty7kNWD0Adicl55CqX38nF8Z8LA73FiaKLbI65wU3WG6KG1xc4yohOfEoXRkEwFd0fe0Jsib9AEsfToBGS51Nk/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>其他说明</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>1.考生须保证提交材料真实、准确，不得弄虚作假，不得有学术不端行为。</span></p><p><span>2.考生须密切关注报名系统中的审核状态及院系复试通知等信息。我院将组织专家对申请材料进行审核，遴选复试名单，并根据上级部门和学校政策规范组织复试考核工作。</span></p><p><span>3.除预报名外，所有通过推荐免试方式攻读我校2027年研究生的考生均须在正式取得推免资格后，在推免服务系统履行填写报考志愿、接收并确认院系的复试及待录取通知等正式程序。推免服务系统正式开放时间请及时关注中国研究生招生信息网相关公告。</span></p><p><span>4.错过预报名的考生如仍有意愿报考我院，可在推免服务系统开通后直接报名。我院将结合实际，确定是否再次组织推免复试考核与录取。</span></p><p><span>5.若上级部门对推免招生工作有新的要求，我院将遵照执行。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/oQyFS1aYtNLLUp29S0fJfooSty7kNWD0Adicl55CqX38nF8Z8LA73FiaKLbI65wU3WG6KG1xc4yohOfEoXRkEwFd0fe0Jsib9AEsfToBGS51Nk/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>咨询方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>许老师</span></p><p><span>yjs@comm.ecnu.edu.cn  </span></p><p><span>021-54343073</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>（学院暑假轮休期间，建议优先通过电子邮件方式咨询）</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/oQyFS1aYtNJxeSjwSCbJfJ7uKHXGL4Z2WibNdcz05icJsxLd9Diac6s490icn95HoaaqpfbFeiaeLMfbpcwywOEb8WB8nTvFrEqVib12JFZXmQxdM/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>欢迎各专业推免生申请攻读华东师大出版硕士专业学位</span></strong><span>！</span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>编辑 | 蒋沁馨</span></span></p><p><span><span>初审 | 杨子婧</span></span></p><p><span><span>复审 | 于  文 邓香莲</span></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/oQyFS1aYtNKqA1kKFnPgzQkZTOtuib8cX1SYvl8JzpqWDoyTcyGHLo4BicXK9hWpuJaicRiannIgDeic2kduXXQdYOudsfZzzjJeLcj5226KD3JI/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"1a4cf9400fc2272df180d6e96c109a5046310a662787f3039d1c1097fde20515","textLength":1840,"sourceSha256":"16aa0b13196f17283b46659f020d46fda126612bf4cfa4053ed832609b141fd5","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-cfccf960642bb059b39f","title":"2026年华东师范大学出版学院推免生预报名公告华东师范大学出版硕士项目2027年招收推荐免试攻读研究生","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:18.467664+00:00"}
